This directory contains tests for all optimization-related Geneva classes.

The tests are written with Catch2 v3 and are aggregated into the
GenevaStandardTests executable. Each source file covers one class or
subsystem; generic per-class checks are additionally exercised through the
standard-tests hooks of the common interface.

CTest registers this one executable as several entries -- shards, each
running a Catch2 test-spec subset of it -- so that the run parallelizes
instead of being held up by the few convergence measurements that dominate
its cost. "ctest -R GenevaStandardTests" runs all of them; running the
executable by hand still runs everything. The shard table, and the
completeness guard that stops a new TEST_CASE from falling outside every
shard, are in CMakeLists.txt here.
